":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Give a hedged opinion.","pt":"Opine.","model":"As far as I know, it works."},{"q":"Ask for agreement.","pt":"Peça.","model":"Do you agree?"},{"q":"Use if you ask me.","pt":"Use.","model":"If you ask me, quality wins."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line response to the podcast.","model":"As far as I know, homework helps older students. Studies about young children are mixed. If you ask me, twenty focused minutes beat two hours of distracted work. Quality matters more than quantity. Do you agree? I would love to hear your view.","checklist":["Usei **As far as I know**","Usei **If you ask me**","Pedi opinião"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “homework study” mean?","opts":["trabalho focado","mensagem de voz","estudo sobre lição de casa"],"ans":2,"why":"**homework study** = estudo sobre lição de casa."},{"q":"What does “focused work” mean?","opts":["trabalho focado","aprendizes jovens","convidado"],"ans":0,"why":"**focused work** = trabalho focado."},{"q":"What does “young learners” mean?","opts":["mensagem de voz","aprendizes jovens","afirmação de pesquisa"],"ans":1,"why":"**young learners** = aprendizes jovens."},{"q":"What does “voice message” mean?","opts":["convidado","longas horas","mensagem de voz"],"ans":2,"why":"**voice message** = mensagem de voz."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das pro